  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oaxaca Strengthening the State&apos;s Management Capacities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Grant is to strengthen the State of Oaxaca&#x2019;s governance and management capacities for better results and effectiveness of the public institutions. This will be achieved by: (i) strengthening public sector management capacities on planning, investment and budgeting; and (ii) developing technical capacities among public servants on social conflict resolution. These activities are designed to enhance the quality of governance on core public administration systems, on the ability to generate consensus in regard to a government program, and on the levels of effectiveness, accountability and transparency to manage public resources; actions that will help the State moving to a development path that contributes to the development challenges and needs of its population.</narrative>
  </description>
